#ASSERT `s 2020(a)(2) State-administered` EQUALS `s 2020(a)(2) State-administered`
#ASSERT `s 2020(a)(2) county-administered` EQUALS `s 2020(a)(2) county-administered`
#ASSERT `s 2020(a)(2) administered on some other basis` EQUALS `s 2020(a)(2) administered on some other basis`
#ASSERT `s 2020(a)(4)(A) any other change` EQUALS `s 2020(a)(4)(A) any other change`
#ASSERT `s 2020(c)(1) some other ground` EQUALS `s 2020(c)(1) some other ground`
#ASSERT `s 2020(c)(2) some other law` EQUALS `s 2020(c)(2) some other law`
#ASSERT (`both determinations`'s `the Secretary determines that the State agency is failing properly to administer the program on the reservation`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`all four factors`'s `the tribal organization's management and fiscal capabilities`) EQUALS TRUE
